OL,3,GNEWSADog walkers oppose planned beach
OL,4,Arestrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore dog walkers have criticised plans
OL,7,Fto ban dogs from part of a Kent beach
OL,8,Fand introduce new lead restrictions in
OL,9,Fthe area.
OL,11,FThanet District Council (TDC) is
OL,12,Fconsulting residents on a Public Spaces
OL,13,FProtection Order (PSPO), which would
OL,14,Fmaintain dog exclusion zones on some
OL,15,Fbeaches and introduce additional
OL,16,Frestrictions in Birchington.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
