OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADog walkers oppose planned beach
OL,4,Arestrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the proposals, dogs would be
OL,7,Fbanned all year from a stretch of beach
OL,8,Fin Birchington. Owners would also be
OL,9,Frequired to keep their pets on leads on
OL,10,Fthe northern sea wall between Cold
OL,11,FHarbour and Plum Pudding.
OL,13,FThe council said the measures were
OL,14,Fneeded to protect wildlife and help
OL,15,Fretain Thanet's Blue Flag beach awards.
OL,16,FThe consultation runs until 9 October.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
